TITLE Mix river water and seawater; report specific conductance
SOLUTION 1 River
    units mg/L
    pH 6.0
    Cl 10
SOLUTION 2 Seawater_simple
    units mg/L
    pH 8.1
    Cl 19000
MIX 1
    1 0.7
    2 0.3
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_sel.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Specific_conductance_uS_cm
10 PUNCH SC
END
